// Task - SL2_MM_AP_Mission_1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1883399030" ""Ready to cause some mayhem in Paragon City? <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go to Atlas Park and hit one of the banks there.</A> Once you hit Atlas you'll have 15 minutes to rob the bank and escape."<br><br><color deepskyblue>This is a Mayhem Mission. You can earn extra time by destroying property and creating diversions away from the bank itself.<br><br>Each type of item rewards a single time bonus after you destroy a certain number of that item. For each person on your team, you will need to destroy more of that particular item to get the time bonus.<br><br>One random side mission can be found on this map. Keys (found by defeating certain enemies) are needed to unlock these side missions. Each completed side mission also rewards a time bonus.<br><br>Every character that is at least level 5 receives a special temporary power the first time they successfully complete this mission.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2252874080" "Rob Atlas Park bank"
// SendOffString :
"P2859158657" "Expect some resistance from Longbow.  They've been monitoring the activities of villains in the Rogue Isles for quite some time."
